{'symbol': 'CB', 'date': '2022-11-11 09:30:00', 'title': 'COMBINED INSURANCE EARNS MILITARY HIRING AWARDS, NAMED #1 MILITARY FRIENDLY® EMPLOYER, AND "BEST FOR VETS" EMPLOYER', 'text': 'CHICAGO , NOV. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMBINED INSURANCE COMPANY OF AMERICA, A CHUBB COMPANY AND A LEADING NORTH AMERICAN PROVIDER OF SUPPLEMENTAL INSURANCE SOLD TO EMPLOYEES AT THE WORKSITE AND DIRECTLY TO INDIVIDUALS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEEN HONORED AS\xa0 AMERICA\'S\xa0#1 MILITARY FRIENDLY® EMPLOYER ($1 BILLION-$4.99 BILLION\xa0REVENUE CATEGORY) AND A " BEST FOR VETS" EMPLOYER \xa0IN RECOGNITION OF ITS RECRUITING AND RETAINMENT EFFORTS. "VETERANS, MILITARY SPOUSES, AND THEIR FAMILY MEMBERS MAKE OUR COMPANY BETTER," SAID RICH WILLIAMS, COMBINED PRESIDENT.'}